Z||000003||rogergarrison||04-18-2001||10:05 AM||||I agree. buy a 5.0. I always had Lincolns myself from 1957-1988. The 80's are almost bulletproof. I put hundreds of thousands of miles on each I owned. I just traded in my 88 town car recently for a minivan, ran perfect with 160K and looked very sharp. Your parents have good taste.||||reg||1
